          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-index">06 / CI &amp; DELIVERY</p><h2 id="delivery-title"><span class="lang-es">Validaciones en GitHub Actions</span><span class="lang-en">GitHub Actions validation</span></h2></div><p class="section-intro lang-es">Ejecución remota consultada para el commit de `main` que etiqueta v1.0.0. No valida esta rama local todavía.</p><p class="section-intro lang-en">Remote run checked for the `main` commit tagged v1.0.0. It does not validate this local branch yet.</p></div>
          <div class="ci-banner"><div class="ci-banner-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div><div><span class="ci-banner-label"><span class="lang-es">EJECUCIÓN REAL VERIFICADA · MAIN</span><span class="lang-en">REAL RUN VERIFIED · MAIN</span></span><strong>3e847f5 · 24 Oct 2026</strong><p class="lang-es">Los cuatro jobs finalizaron con éxito en GitHub Actions.</p><p class="lang-en">All four jobs completed successfully in GitHub Actions.</p></div><a class="button button-outline" href={ciRun} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="lang-es">Ver ejecución</span><span class="lang-en">View run</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
