      <section class="section section-border" id="security" aria-labelledby="security-title">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-index">07 / SECURITY BY DESIGN</p><h2 id="security-title"><span class="lang-es">Los límites también son arquitectura</span><span class="lang-en">Security boundaries are architecture</span></h2></div><p class="section-intro lang-es">El laboratorio está aislado para aprendizaje. Una ruta de observación no debe convertirse en una API de administración expuesta.</p><p class="section-intro lang-en">The lab is isolated for learning. An observation path must not become an exposed administration API.</p></div>
          <div class="security-grid">
            <article class="security-card"><span class="security-symbol">01</span><h3><span class="lang-es">Sin socket en contenedores</span><span class="lang-en">No socket in containers</span></h3><p class="lang-es">Ningún servicio recibe `/var/run/docker.sock`. El exporter host-side usa Docker CLI, pero su usuario mantiene facultades importantes sobre el daemon.</p><p class="lang-en">No service receives `/var/run/docker.sock`. The host-side exporter uses Docker CLI, while its user retains significant daemon privileges.</p></article>
            <article class="security-card"><span class="security-symbol">02</span><h3><span class="lang-es">Redes y alcance privados</span><span class="lang-en">Private network scope</span></h3><p class="lang-es">Prometheus, Alertmanager, exporters y webhook no son servicios públicos. La red local de Docker Desktop no equivale a un firewall de aplicación.</p><p class="lang-en">Prometheus, Alertmanager, exporters, and webhook are not public services. Docker Desktop networking is not an application firewall.</p></article>
            <article class="security-card"><span class="security-symbol">03</span><h3><span class="lang-es">Secretos fuera del repositorio</span><span class="lang-en">Secrets stay out of Git</span></h3><p class="lang-es">`.env` y `data/` se excluyen de Git. El portal no usa credenciales, variables secretas, base de datos ni API privada.</p><p class="lang-en">`.env` and `data/` are excluded from Git. The portfolio has no credentials, secret variables, database, or private API.</p></article>
            <article class="security-card"><span class="security-symbol">04</span><h3><span class="lang-es">Telemetría no es SLO</span><span class="lang-en">Telemetry is not an SLO</span></h3><p class="lang-es">Las capturas son evidencias fechadas. `host.docker.internal` facilita una ruta desde Docker Desktop, pero no autentica al cliente Prometheus.</p><p class="lang-en">Screenshots are dated evidence. `host.docker.internal` provides a Docker Desktop route but does not authenticate the Prometheus client.</p></article>
          </div>
          <a class="text-link" href={`${repositoryDocs}/cloud/security-model.md`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="lang-es">Ver modelo de seguridad para OCI y el portal</span><span class="lang-en">Read the OCI and portfolio security model</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

